Subject: Configure pnpm workspace linker
Origin: DHI-internal (DHI build harness)
Description: Set the hoisted node linker and copy imports in the workspace
 file because pnpm rejects these required package-build settings globally.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/renovatebot/renovate.git 4fa5d0a04a23b0e815b32fa6fdbdd325a064f426
Verify: cmd `grep -xF -e 'nodeLinker: hoisted' -e 'packageImportMethod: copy' pnpm-workspace.yaml` expect "linker settings"
Forwarded: not-needed (DHI build configuration)
Drop-When: never: DHI package builds require deterministic hoisted copies; review on version updates

diff --git a/pnpm-workspace.yaml b/pnpm-workspace.yaml
--- a/pnpm-workspace.yaml
+++ b/pnpm-workspace.yaml
@@ -70,3 +70,6 @@
   - argparse@3.0.3

 provenance: true
+
+nodeLinker: hoisted
+packageImportMethod: copy
